{"id":137636364,"slug":"frontier-update-night-3-of-monarch","title":"Frontier Update: Night 3 of Monarch eTNS Use Has Been Awesome","subtitle":"A report from the front lines of gonzo brain modulation reporting.","post_date":"2023-10-03T21:20:08.245Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/frontier-update-night-3-of-monarch","wordcount":171,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:56:54.007Z","body_sha256":"f871609fde32867b4db8f5c792a3aafc8f66bc3acc7fd344f01949b455571ce1","text_words":173,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>I have attention deficit hyperactivity disorder.  I had previously written about the monarchy eTNS device.  I have been prescribed the monarch eTNS device.</p><p>This is a brain simulator.   You wear it on your forehead.  It feels like a little tickle, but just barely.  An “almost tickle.”</p><p>It looks …silly.  Or I look silly.  Both of those answers are probably correct.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1941\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1941,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1805693,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_H5J!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F20e2e33d-fcdb-4a47-8f76-77d6b2042773_3088x2316.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>It changes the brain by stimulating cranial nerve V division 1 (that is the trigeminal nerve for those of you studying for step one of the US Medical Licence exam).</p><p>I woke up today with a sense of <em>calm purpose.</em></p><p>More results to follow.</p><p>But it's something.  A reminder, this medical device is FDA approved, for use in children seven through 12, for the treatment of attention deficit hyperactivity disorder as a monotherapy.  I suspect does quite a bit more than just that.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2023/10/03/2753731/0/en/NeuroSigma-Announces-HSA-Approval-of-the-Monarch-eTNS-System-in-Singapore.html\">As an aside, the company has a press release today about its approval in Singapore.</a></p><p>It is a Brains Stimulation future?  Maybe.  We will see.</p><p>Thanks for reading.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>","text":"I have attention deficit hyperactivity disorder. I had previously written about the monarchy eTNS device. I have been prescribed the monarch eTNS device.\n\nThis is a brain simulator. You wear it on your forehead. It feels like a little tickle, but just barely. An “almost tickle.”\n\nIt looks …silly. Or I look silly. Both of those answers are probably correct.\n\nIt changes the brain by stimulating cranial nerve V division 1 (that is the trigeminal nerve for those of you studying for step one of the US Medical Licence exam).\n\nI woke up today with a sense of calm purpose.\n\nMore results to follow.\n\nBut it's something. A reminder, this medical device is FDA approved, for use in children seven through 12, for the treatment of attention deficit hyperactivity disorder as a monotherapy. I suspect does quite a bit more than just that.\n\nAs an aside, the company has a press release today about its approval in Singapore.\n\nIt is a Brains Stimulation future? Maybe. We will see.\n\nThanks for reading.\n\nSubscribe now"}